# Redirect map — Cloudflare Pages / Netlify format
#
# Source of truth: inventory/pages.md. Every line here is tested individually
# before launch, not sampled. A 404 on an old donation link is the worst
# possible outcome of a redesign.
#
# Format: <from> <to> <status>
# 301 = permanent (tells search engines to transfer ranking)
# 200 = rewrite (URL stays, different file is served)

